  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "In the shop",
     "texto": [
      "The shop assistant will say **Posso ajudar?** (can I help you?).",
      "You ask: **Queria ver aquele casaco** (I'd like to see that jacket).",
      "**Que tamanho?** = what size? The size is **o tamanho**: o tamanho M.",
      "**Posso experimentar?** = can I try it on? They'll send you to **os provadores** (the fitting rooms)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How it fits and how much it costs",
     "texto": [
      "**Fica-me bem** = it suits me. **Fica-lhe bem** = it suits you (formal).",
      "**É caro** (it's expensive), **é barato** (it's cheap). **Tem um tamanho maior?** = do you have a bigger size?",
      "**Levo** = I'll take it."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Paying",
     "texto": [
      "**Posso pagar com cartão?** = can I pay by card?",
      "**Em dinheiro** = in cash. **Dinheiro** is «money».",
      "**Claro** = of course."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
